    {
      "timestamp": "2026-08-30T22:27:55.406815+00:00",
      "type": "understanding",
      "summary": "Agent explained goal and mechanics.",
      "understanding": {
        "goal_understanding": "Navigate each level\u2019s grid to complete (activate and then step onto) every goal cell. A goal is completed only when the carried piece\u2019s shape, color, and rotation exactly match that goal\u2019s required attributes at the moment you step onto the goal tile. Completing all goals advances to the next level; finishing all levels wins.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each turn you choose a movement action (e.g., MOVE_NORTH/SOUTH/EAST/WEST). Moving typically costs stamina; trying to move into a wall fails to change position but still consumes stamina. Stepping on modifier tiles changes the carried piece\u2019s attributes: shape modifiers cycle the shape, color modifiers cycle the color, and rotation modifiers rotate the piece 90\u00b0 clockwise. You must route through modifiers as needed to match a goal\u2019s requirements, then step onto the goal tile while matched to complete it. Running out of stamina costs a life; losing all lives ends the game."
      }
    }
